# FathomFollow workflow

This repo uses an agentic build contract. Before implementation work:

1. Read `agent-prompt.md` and `implementation-spec.md` → **Current State**
2. Run `ff-status` (or `ff-status --check-diary` at session end)
3. Follow TDD: red → green → refactor; append diary entries per step

**Do not** edit `implementation-plan.md`. Metrics that matter for the plan go in `docs/baselines.json` + the diary, not only gitignored `runs/`.

**Multi-machine:** GPU build machine owns training/integration gates; git carries code + spec + baselines. See `docs/workflow.md`.

**Daily ritual:** `fathomfollow-daily-workflow` skill (start + end + PM vs builder chats).

**Skills:** `fathomfollow-resume` (deep catch-up), `fathomfollow-session-end` (wrap-up), `fathomfollow-daily-workflow` (routine).

**Human cheat sheet:** `docs/pm-cheatsheet.md`

Standing rules from `agent-prompt.md`: no HoloOcean/GS in unit tests; no ground truth outside `src/fathomfollow/eval/`.
